{"ticker":{"symbol":"087260.KQ","name":"모바일어플라이언스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":247.0,"change_pct":0.0,"market_cap":8040556544.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":2560.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"South Korea","city":"Anyang-si","employees":51,"website":"https://www.mobileappliance.co.kr","business_summary":"Mobile Appliance, Inc. develops, manufactures, and exports car safety devices in South Korea and internationally. It offers LBS related navigation, heads up display (HUD), autonomous driving related (ADAS), car DVRs, black boxes, and other related car safety products. The company also provides connected, internet of things, driver monitoring systems, vehicle to load, interior camera, personal navigation devices solutions. Mobile Appliance, Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Anyang-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"모바일 어플라이언스(주)는 자동차 안전 장치를 개발, 제조, 국내 및 해외로 수출하는 회사입니다. LBS 관련 내비게이션, 헤드업 디스플레이(HUD), 자율주행 관련(ADAS), 차량용 DVR, 블랙박스 등 자동차 안전관련 제품을 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 또한 연결된 사물 인터넷, 운전자 모니터링 시스템, 차량 적재, 실내 카메라, 개인 내비게이션 장치 솔루션을 제공합니다. 모바일 어플라이언스(주)는 2004년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 안양시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"과학·계측기기","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":52471269380.0,"operating_income":-717208310.0,"net_income":2110183010.0,"eps":65.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":49804458550.0,"operating_income":452466840.0,"net_income":2110182810.0,"eps":65.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":40480792130.0,"operating_income":972395090.0,"net_income":1400703090.0,"eps":30.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":34943028820.0,"operating_income":-895803660.0,"net_income":-565352330.0,"eps":-17.0}],"price_history":[],"analyst":{"n_analysts":null,"rating":"","strong_buy":0,"buy":0,"hold":0